From: Michal Cieslakiewicz <michal.cieslakiewicz@wp.pl>
Subject: [PATCH] mac80211: ath9k: enable GPIO buttons (header fixup)

Backports already contains nearly all GPIO button support changes from
this patch series, but the `btnpdev` member is missing from `struct
ath_softc` in this tree revision. Keep this patch as a minimal header
fixup so gpio.c references compile.

--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath9k/ath9k.h
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath9k/ath9k.h
@@ -1053,6 +1053,7 @@ struct ath_softc {
 	struct list_head leds;
 #ifdef CONFIG_GPIOLIB
 	struct gpio_chip *gpiochip;
+	struct platform_device *btnpdev;	/* gpio-keys-polled */
 	struct gpio_desc *gpiodesc;
 #endif
 #endif
